# Startup policy: confirm HOME, then enter EDIT for this editor-oriented regression.
wait 300
expect view 0
tap EDIT
expect view 1
# PERF keeps the last crash's numbers (its red screen's) until power-off, to photograph (fm1-x0x#17)
wait 300
fakecrash
tap GLO
turn SELECT 18
tap SEL
wait 1200
shot crash_on_perf.png
